# INVWINS.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item form from
# the item list.  ENTER on item 2 opens it in view mode, and OK leaves
# it; CTRL-E edits it, the quantity is changed and OK saves it; the list
# shows the new quantity and keeps the item selected, and ENTER shows
# the item again, unsnapped: the save set its Updated date from the
# test machine's clock.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINS.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K DOWN ENTER
S VIEW2
# OK leaves the view; the list is as it was
K ENTER
S BACK
# CTRL-E edits; the focus starts on Category; 5 TABs reach Quantity
K CTRL-E
S EDIT2
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 5
S TYPED
# OK saves: the list shows the new quantity, item 2 still selected
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER
K ENTER
S DONE
